@startuml seq-federation-stub
' Context: federation
' Profile: platform
' SDD: SYS-DELIVERY (outbox federato)
' Revision: 2026-09-15

title Federation — outbound federato (target)

participant "AccountBoundary" as AB
database "Outbox" as OB
participant "DeliveryRouter" as DR
participant "GothamEgress" as GE
participant "TickModule" as TM
participant "FederatedServer" as EXT

AB -> OB : QueueDelivery (event_kind=deliver)\npeer_address con @server remoto
note over OB
  Stessa outbox locale/federato.
  Codice main: queued senza consumer Gotham.
end note

OB -> DR : ProcessOutbox
DR -> GE : claim (ramo external)

opt MESSAGE con allegato
  GE -> GE : mint media_fetch_url
end

GE -> EXT : POST /gotham/v1/events\nfrom_user/to_user bare + firma
EXT --> GE : HTTP 2xx

GE -> TM : modulo spunte unificato\ndelivered_at mittente
GE -> OB : DeliveryCompleted

note over DR, GE
  Ramo internal: DeliverInternal
  (copia media server-side) — vedi seq-media-ingest-on-delivery.puml
end note

@enduml
